## Abandonment or re-scope conditions

Stop and seek an owner scope amendment if implementation needs a core lifecycle/protocol/CLI authority feature, changes an existing pack identity, cannot keep the research phase meaningful without conditional semantics, or cannot distinguish the old candidate’s historical validation from current-source validation.
